05CF                          IF   CPM   
05CF                             ; RAM pages, after the image
05CF                CPAGE:    EQU   (imgend + 255) / 256   ; the skip cache (QK builds), first, so
05CF                RSPAGE:   EQU   CPAGE + QK   ;   that the letter page is still the one
05CF                DSPAGE:   EQU   RSPAGE + 1   ;   just below the program text
05CF                LETPAGE:   EQU   RSPAGE + 2   
05CF                PROG:     EQU   LETPAGE*256 + 256   
05CF                          ENDIF      
05CF                IMGEND:      


